<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"Noto Sans SC","Source Han Sans SC","PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 120, padding: '34px 64px 0', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>兜底链：每一级降级都「如实标注」</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 8 }}>demo 可以降级，但不能撒谎——用户看到的永远是真实状态</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 540, padding: '20px 64px 0', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 300, background: '#EFF6FF', border: '1px solid #BFDBFE', borderRadius: 14, padding: '24px 22px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#2563EB', letterSpacing: 3, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>FALLBACK</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 12 }}>demo 可以降级，<br />但不能撒谎</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 5, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #2563EB 0%, #06B6D4 100%)', borderRadius: 3, margin: '16px 0 16px' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>每一级降级都在响应里显式标注——degraded、rag_unavailable。用户看到的是真实状态，不是一个假装正常的系统。演示可以没有模型，但不能没有诚实。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #BFDBFE', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 14px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>5</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.45, flex: 1 }}>级兜底路径<br />每一级都有测试守护</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #BFDBFE', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 14px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E40AF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>底线：LLM 全部留空<br />也能跑完全链路。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderLeft: '4px solid #2563EB', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace', width: 30 }}>01</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>L1 库挂 → 跳过前置层</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 2 }}>FAQ 读不到不影响主链路，照常走 RAG / direct，只是少了秒查层。</Text>
                </Box>
                <FAIcon name='check-circle' style={{ fill: '#2563EB', width: 20, height: 20 }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderLeft: '4px solid #2563EB', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace', width: 30 }}>02</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>Milvus 挂 → rag_unavailable</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 2 }}>明确告知「知识检索不可用」，且这个状态绝不写进缓存。</Text>
                </Box>
                <FAIcon name='check-circle' style={{ fill: '#2563EB', width: 20, height: 20 }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderLeft: '4px solid #06B6D4', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E7490', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace', width: 30 }}>03</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>LLM 挂 → 回放最相关片段</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 2 }}>不编造：把检索到的原文直接给用户，并标注 degraded = True。</Text>
                </Box>
                <FAIcon name='check-circle' style={{ fill: '#0E7490', width: 20, height: 20 }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderLeft: '4px solid #06B6D4', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E7490', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace', width: 30 }}>04</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>RAG miss + how_to → 回落 L1</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 2 }}>找不到完整流程就明说「未找到完整流程」，不装懂、不硬答。</Text>
                </Box>
                <FAIcon name='check-circle' style={{ fill: '#0E7490', width: 20, height: 20 }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderLeft: '4px solid #94A3B8', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#64748B', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace', width: 30 }}>05</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>遥测写失败 → 只告警不抛</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 2 }}>统计落库失败不影响回答本身，日志告警即可，问答照常返回。</Text>
                </Box>
                <FAIcon name='check-circle' style={{ fill: '#64748B', width: 20, height: 20 }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#0F172A', borderRadius: 12, padding: '13px 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 5, height: 30, borderRadius: 3, background: '#06B6D4' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#F8FAFC', lineHeight: 1.45, flex: 1 }}>LLM 全部留空 = 离线模式：规则路由 + 模板结论，全链路依然跑得完</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 64px', position: 'relative' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 12, height: 12, borderRadius: 3, background: '#2563EB' }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 9, height: 9, borderRadius: 5, background: '#06B6D4' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>mfg-agent-platform · 独立开发实践分享</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>14 / 20</Text>
        <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 3, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #2563EB 0%, #06B6D4 55%, rgba(6,182,212,0) 100%)' }} />
    </Box>
</Slide>
